<title>USA: America West offers holiday fares.</title>
<headline>America West offers holiday fares.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>America West Airlines Inc said on Wednesday it would offer one-way fares as low as $60 throughout most of its system from November 23 through January 8 with no &quot;blackout&quot; dates or restricted dates.</p>
<p>Airlines typically restrict sale fares during the Thanksgiving, Christmas and New Year's travel rush.</p>
<p>Nonrefundable tickets must be purchased no later than October 4 and some restrictions apply, the airline said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
